# Fail-closed allowlist.
#
# This folder holds private scan output next to the code (data/, intel/, logs/, ...).
# Everything at the top level is therefore ignored unless it is named below, so a new file
# or folder is private by default. To publish something new, add it to the list.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.claude/
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/README.md
!/bvs.ps1
!/start-dashboard.cmd
!/docs/
!/src/
!/tests/

# Inside the published folders: machine-specific or generated, never commit.
/src/config/local/
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/
/tests/ui/shots/
/tests/ui/*-stub*
/tests/fixtures/demo-scan/js/
/tests/fixtures/demo-scan/summary.json
/tests/fixtures/delete-sandbox/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp-*
